WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.460
In order to be brave,

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:02.820
you've got to be a little bit scared

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.500
I need you to be brave right now

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:10.600
You ever miss it?

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:11.820
I haven't touched a gun in ten years

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:14.380
After what happened that night

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.140
FBI, SHOW ME YOUR HANDS

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.160
I just put my sword down, you know?

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:23.920
Without that bad luck

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:24.420
(You're gonna be ok)

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.100
I never would have met Sarah

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:29.580
I never would have had my kids

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:30.360
Daddy loves who?

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.500
Me! Me! ME!

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.180
I love you

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:34.720
You'd better!

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.520
Mr Sawyer, you are the very first family we have had

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:42.480
in the residential section of the Pearl

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.280
After your security assessment, what do you think of the building?

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:48.600
The Pearl is the most advanced super-tall structure in the world

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.900
It's a breathtaking achievement

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:52.960
But...?

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:55.220
No one really knows what would happen if things go wrong

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.400
[whistles]

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.560
Hello boys

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:09.280
Let it burn

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.500
The 96th floor is on fire

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:16.040
Sarah, listen to be - the fire is not going to stop

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.820
Keep going up, don't stop, don't look back

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:18.320
OK

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:22.900
Get back! WHOA, WHOA, WHOA, WHOA! You don't understand, my family is in there

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:23.400
Turn around!

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.280
Ok, don't looks down

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:40.620
That was dumb

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:51.200
How did you get in the building?!

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.960
Jumped off a super-crane

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:53.540
What?!

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.280
Just the man I was looking for

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:58.780
This building

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:00.600
Is protecting something that I want

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.040
You're going to get it for me

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:06.820
Anything can be done, with the proper motivation

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:08.380
NO!

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:10.040
DADDY!

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.720
We gotta do this together

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:22.120
I'm scared

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.300
It's OK to be scared

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:29.980
In order to be brave, you've got to be a little scared

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.740
I gotta get you outta this building - I need you to be brave right now, OK?

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:36.400
Yeah

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:36.960
Daddy loves who?

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:37.460
Me

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:42.140
Hold on!

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:43.580
3...

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:46.760
2...

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:49.080
1!

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:13.880
I'll do whatever it takes

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:14.920
to keep my family safe

